  "body": "Essential viewing - seriously for sale. The architecture is striking, the construction is substantial, and the spaces have been planned with genuine thought for how your family deserves to enjoy living. \r\nBuilt in 2019 on a freehold 588sqm site, this 301sqm residence is a seriously impressive piece of residential architecture. Black steel, warm timber and expansive glazing give it a distinctly elevated Kiwi character, while its elevated north-facing position captures views across Glover Park and towards Rangitoto, with further water views stretching west.\r\n\r\nSolid American oak floors, a floating staircase connecting all three levels, double glazing and comprehensive ducted heating are just some of the details that set it apart. The remaining balance of the 10-year building warranty provides further reassurance.\r\n\r\nThe three-level floor plan is exceptionally versatile. The ground floor provides a separate lounge, two double bedrooms and an extremely spacious bathroom, making it ideal for teenagers, guests or extended family. The mid-level is the heart of the home, with generous living and dining flowing into a beautifully appointed chef's kitchen with substantial island and butler's pantry. Two further double bedrooms, an office and separate laundry complete this level.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the primary suite occupies the entire third floor - complete with walk-in wardrobe, make-up counter, beautifully tiled ensuite and excellent storage.\r\n\r\nThe lift connecting the ground floor with the mid-level is an unusual and very useful inclusion, particularly when the double garage sits directly alongside it. There is also internal access and twin EV chargers.\r\n\r\nTropical planting surrounds a LouvreTec-covered paved entertaining area, with a gas fire and two outdoor heaters making it usable throughout the year. There is tiger turf for the kids, a hot tub for the adults and plenty of space to simply switch off.\r\n\r\nThe gardens and outdoor infrastructure have matured beautifully since the home was built, giving the property a settled, established feel that you simply cannot replicate overnight.\r\n\r\nThe commitment to quality is evident throughout, and the result is a sophisticated, highly functional home that is equally suited to family life, entertaining or simply enjoying the exceptional spaces for yourself.",
